{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.","source":"{"address":"224 Helena St","attributes":{"Ambience":{"casual":true,"classy":true,"divey":null,"hipster":null,"intimate":null,"romantic":false,"touristy":false,"trendy":true,"upscale":false},"BusinessParking":{"garage":false,"lot":true,"street":true,"valet":false,"validated":false},"Music":true,"OutdoorSeating":true,"RestaurantsGoodForGroups":true,"RestaurantsReservations":true,"RestaurantsTakeOut":true,"WiFi":"free"},"business_stars":4.0,"categories":"Lounges, Art Galleries, American (New), Bars, Shopping, Nightlife, Restaurants, Music Venues, Gastropubs, Cocktail Bars, Arts & Entertainment","city":"Santa Barbara","hours":{"Friday":"16:0-1:0","Monday":"0:0-0:0","Saturday":"14:0-1:0","Sunday":"14:0-23:0","Thursday":"17:0-0:0","Wednesday":"17:0-0:0"},"name":"Seven Bar & Kitchen","review_info":[{"review_date":"2021-12-27 07:24:20","review_stars":1.0,"review_text":"Staff wasn't friendly. Bathroom was absolutely disgusting, like it had not been cleaned in a week. Drinks were wrong and kicked out at 11pm (before closing time) into 40 degree weather.  My conversation was interrupted mid conversation to close out our tab an hour before posted closing time. Would've been nice to at least wait for the Uber inside."},{"review_date":"2021-11-19 07:53:01","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"In a town that closes down fairly early midweek it's nice to have SB&K for late night vittles.\n\nAnd right in the middle of the Funk Zone, it's always fun to be amongst party-people who are out having a fun time. Right across the street from Test Pilot, and around the corner from Figueroa Mountain Brewery.\n\nThe inside bar area was a buzz of activity, and we headed out to their outside patio area for a nice table. Under the stars and with heaters full blas